sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Buyer as Customer
    participant UI as React Storefront / Modal
    participant Backend as Express Payment Controller
    participant Razorpay as Razorpay Cloud Gateway
    participant Database as MongoDB Atlas
    participant Invoice as PDFKit Invoice Service
    participant Sockets as Socket.IO Server

    Note over Buyer, Sockets: Phase 1: Order Generation & Payment Request
    Buyer->>UI: Confirm Razorpay Payment Option
    UI->>Backend: POST /api/orders/checkout (addressId, method: "razorpay")
    Backend->>Razorpay: Create Order (amountPaise, currency: "INR", receipt: orderNum)
    Razorpay-->>Backend: Return { id: "order_xyz", amount: 49900, status: "created" }
    Backend->>Database: Save Order as 'pending_payment'
    Backend-->>UI: Return Razorpay Order ID & Public Key
    UI->>Buyer: Open Secure Razorpay Checkout Modal

    Note over Buyer, Sockets: Phase 2: Gateway Authorization
    Buyer->>Razorpay: Select UPI / Credit Card / NetBanking & Authorize
    alt Payment Authorized
        Razorpay-->>UI: Return { razorpay_order_id, razorpay_payment_id, razorpay_signature }
        UI->>Backend: POST /api/payments/verify (Signature Verification Payload)
        Backend->>Backend: Compute HMAC SHA256 (order_id + "|" + payment_id, secret)
        alt Signature Matches
            Backend->>Database: Start Transaction: Set Status = 'confirmed' & Decrement Stock
            Database-->>Backend: Stock Committed Cleanly
            Backend->>Invoice: Generate PDF Tax Invoice
            Invoice-->>Database: Store Invoice Record
            Backend->>Sockets: Emit 'order:created' to Vendor Room
            Backend-->>UI: 200 OK (Payment Verified & Order Confirmed)
            UI-->>Buyer: Show Order Success & Download Invoice Button
        else Signature Mismatch (Tampering Attempt)
            Backend->>Database: Flag Order as 'fraud_review'
            Backend-->>UI: 400 Bad Request (Invalid Payment Signature)
            UI-->>Buyer: Show Security Alert
        end
    else User Dismisses or Payment Fails
        Razorpay-->>UI: Payment Cancelled / Failed
        UI->>Backend: POST /api/payments/failed (orderId, errorDetails)
        Backend->>Database: Mark Payment Record as 'failed'
        UI-->>Buyer: Prompt Retry with Alternate Payment Method
    end
